      "description": "The 13 dives in the analysis: every localized dive HB1603 recorded except SWD_20160703-OE20, whose dive data is incorrect.\nSpelled as the set that is included rather than the one excluded, which is what plan_dive_datasets accepts and is also the more useful record. It states the analysis population outright, and plan_dive_datasets raises if a label names a dive no config provides, so a renamed or missing config stops the run instead of quietly shrinking the study.\nSWD_20160707-OE20-OE29-OE32 is absent because it is not a fourteenth dive. It is a combined view of three July 7 dives that each have their own config, and it carries no 99% confidence lines, so it cannot drive the coding step. plan_dive_datasets skips it by default."
